{"id": "EUVD-2026-55577", "enisaUuid": "edee37ee-081c-343e-b15b-a83a70174a8b", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: mgmt: hold reference for hci_conn in mgmt_pending_cmds\n\nDereferencing RCU-protected pointers outside critical sections is\ninvalid and may lead to UAF.  Use of hci_conn in hci_sync callbacks also\nneeds to hold refcount to avoid UAF.\n\nTake appropriate locks for hci_conn lookups, and take refcount for\nhci_conn pointers stored in mgmt_pending_cmd so that the pointer stays\nvalid.\n\nWhen accessing conn->state, ensure hdev->lock is held to avoid data\nrace.", "datePublished": "2026-08-10T12:04:10", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T21:09:07", "baseScore": 7.8, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/84674dd1d3192ecb050827d3148642609c0c9dbb", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b56f2ecafc08f372bf0529f9c4f3f429cb1702dc", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f915e74b6f18293d1d69a2a3305ef321ff7c0172", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d5b3b484b62bb0f4542e7622789d28871626cdf0", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ecdcb55ea1c01dda074406f38058785a69526734", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/da55f570191d5d72f10c607a7043b947eb05ea46"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-68391", "GHSA-r93r-qrfp-h69j"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "07c901f3-eee6-3d76-b4ec-f77d6864dc43", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.1.6"}, {"id": "0e019be6-2dcb-31eb-97c2-601cf4cb5c1d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7b445e220db9a2c58be5d09bbbd322abf1b1452a <da55f570191d5d72f10c607a7043b947eb05ea46"}, {"id": "17aa11e7-5cd2-317e-8a7b-aa794c416cf0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7b445e220db9a2c58be5d09bbbd322abf1b1452a <ecdcb55ea1c01dda074406f38058785a69526734"}, {"id": "1a7080ca-3030-3a2e-8944-b319488c17d6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "2657f008-b501-32c6-b3e3-6a45ec414479", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.101"}, {"id": "2c363f22-1346-39a6-aaf8-de123336cd29", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.42"}, {"id": "48c920ec-e9ce-38d1-97c8-dbde096546d3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2"}, {"id": "4b12a3e5-dbce-3c78-bd69-88d3a5c8710f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7b445e220db9a2c58be5d09bbbd322abf1b1452a <d5b3b484b62bb0f4542e7622789d28871626cdf0"}, {"id": "5bca00b0-3785-3a82-8abc-1bbaa0ca5f17", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7b445e220db9a2c58be5d09bbbd322abf1b1452a <b56f2ecafc08f372bf0529f9c4f3f429cb1702dc"}, {"id": "5fb93d52-ed97-3f8e-b923-771aa270ccc9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7b445e220db9a2c58be5d09bbbd322abf1b1452a <f915e74b6f18293d1d69a2a3305ef321ff7c0172"}, {"id": "617d0a9b-444e-34bf-80c3-1016c6dc3906", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7b445e220db9a2c58be5d09bbbd322abf1b1452a <84674dd1d3192ecb050827d3148642609c0c9dbb"}, {"id": "c9820d39-396c-3099-87e6-de5b47c12d9f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.0"}, {"id": "dcc58468-2670-37ff-aa7e-33384863302e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.1.189"}, {"id": "eb436e83-c307-3e1a-b739-b0f45394dfa3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.148"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "2c445646-48d2-3031-86af-6ee9ea7f0395", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}